{"manifest_version": 3, "name": "Cookie & Privacy Manager", "version": "1.0.0", "description": "Xem danh s\u00e1ch site \u0111ang l\u01b0u cookie tr\u00ean m\u00e1y b\u1ea1n, xo\u00e1 cookie theo site, v\u00e0 xem IP c\u00f4ng khai c\u1ee7a ch\u00ednh b\u1ea1n (\u1ea9n/hi\u1ec7n).", "action": {"default_popup": "popup.html", "default_title": "Cookie & Privacy Manager"}, "permissions": ["cookies", "storage"], "host_permissions": ["<all_urls>", "https://api.ipify.org/*"], "browser_specific_settings": {"gecko": {"id": "cookie-privacy-manager@example.com", "strict_min_version": "109.0", "data_collection_permissions": {"required": ["none"]}}}}